[42.465, "o", "[2026-08-31 21:07:51-0300] [STAGE:live-matrix] [2026-08-31 21:07:51-0300] If you provided your own bootstrap password during installation, browse to https://rancher.k3s.lab.internal to get started.\r\n"]
